      "description": "<p><strong>Activate</strong> <img src=\"assets/images/actions/f.png\" title=\"free action\" alt=\"free action\"> (concentrate)</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You hit an off-guard creature with the affixed weapon</p>\n<hr />\n<p>This long, hollow proboscis is harvested from the notorious bloodseeker beast and drips a trickle of blood.</p>\n<p>When you activate the beak, you deal an extra <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> precision damage on your damage roll. If you deal sneak attack damage to the creature, you also deal <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> bleed.</p>\n",
